'''Sweets''' (スイーツ, ''Suītsu'', '''Sweets''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Recharge UP (M): Cat Cannon will charge 15 seconds faster.

